    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I don't know if it's any better, but this works without casting:\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n  const banner = BannerComponent ? bannerData : undefined;\r\n\r\n  const bannerComponent = BannerComponent\r\n    ? (bannerComponentProps: {\r\n        banner: Required<HitsUiComponentProps<Hit<THit>>>['banner'];\r\n        className: string;\r\n      }) => <BannerComponent {...bannerComponentProps} />\r\n    : undefined;\r\n```",
    "commit_id": "1fdb88fbc8c7f0c1738ca41a99202aab6f99ca07",
